1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,042
Meet WindowMochi
A little mochi. A tidier desktop.

2
00:00:09,042 --> 00:00:20,125
1. Launch the app
Open WindowMochi.app, then look in the menu bar.

3
00:00:20,125 --> 00:00:32,458
2. Allow window control
System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility

4
00:00:32,458 --> 00:00:42,875
3. Save your layout
Arrange windows on both displays, then save.

5
00:00:42,875 --> 00:00:53,958
4. Restore in one click
Move your windows, then choose your saved layout.

6
00:00:53,958 --> 00:01:04,042
5. Switch with shortcuts
Keep WindowMochi running in the background.

7
00:01:04,042 --> 00:01:15,792
6. Choose your language
Language changes immediately and stays saved.

8
00:01:15,792 --> 00:01:28,917
Permission still not working?
Re-add the exact app you are running.
